**Why**: emphasis at the very top of a file.

# Heading
*Note* right after a heading.

- item
__Bold__ right after a list item.

> quote
_It_ right after a quote.

- **Lead** at the start of a list item's text
* a star list item stays a list item
***

A paragraph line
**after** a plain line already worked, and *in the middle* too.
